diff --git a/doc/changes/dev/14368.bugfix.rst b/doc/changes/dev/14368.bugfix.rst
new file mode 100644
index 00000000000..81c382e0760
--- /dev/null
+++ b/doc/changes/dev/14368.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Fix bug where hovering over a figure containing several butterfly plots, e.g. from repeated calls to :meth:`mne.Evoked.plot` or :meth:`mne.time_frequency.Spectrum.plot` with ``axes``, redrew the entire figure once per plot on every mouse movement, by `Eric Larson`_.
diff --git a/doc/changes/dev/14368.newfeature.rst b/doc/changes/dev/14368.newfeature.rst
new file mode 100644
index 00000000000..016de1ace08
--- /dev/null
+++ b/doc/changes/dev/14368.newfeature.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Add ``selectable`` parameter to :meth:`mne.time_frequency.Spectrum.plot` and :meth:`mne.time_frequency.EpochsSpectrum.plot` to disable interactive features, by `Eric Larson`_.
